 Electronics | {"buckets": [{"key": "Apple", "doc_count": 1}, {"key": "Dell", "doc_count": 1}, {"key": "HP", "doc_count": 1}], "sum_other_doc_count": 0} | {"value": 3299.9700000000003} |     3
 Sports      | {"buckets": [{"key": "Adidas", "doc_count": 1}, {"key": "Nike", "doc_count": 1}], "sum_other_doc_count": 0}                               | {"value": 209.98}             |     2
